# git-crypt — encrypted game internals.
#
# The key is symmetric (no GPG collaborator list): `git-crypt export-key`
# writes it, and a clone without it sees these paths as binary. Everything
# encrypted sits behind an off-by-default cargo feature, so a clone with no
# key still builds and runs the game — it just gets the public half.
apps/arcade/colony/src/private/** filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt

